    "Deleted transactions appear here for %lld days and can be restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除的交易会在这里保留 %lld 天，可以恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除的交易會在這裡保留 %lld 天，可以恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleted transactions stay here for %lld days, then are removed for good. Restoring puts a transaction back exactly as it was, and balances, analytics and budgets count it again. Swipe right to restore, left to delete permanently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除的交易会在这里保留 %lld 天，之后永久删除。恢复后交易与原来完全一致，余额、统计和预算会重新计入。向右轻扫恢复，向左轻扫永久删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除的交易會在這裡保留 %lld 天，之後永久刪除。恢復後交易與原來完全一致，餘額、統計和預算會重新計入。向右輕掃恢復，向左輕掃永久刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting a tag removes it from transactions; the transactions themselves are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除标签会将其从交易中移除，交易本身会保留。"
