    "Each part is counted in its own category for reports and budgets. The account balance changes once, by the total.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一部分在统计和预算中计入各自的分类；账户余额只按总额变动一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一部分在統計和預算中計入各自的分類；帳戶餘額只按總額變動一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each part needs a category and an amount.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一项都需要选择分类并填写金额。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一項都需要選擇分類並填寫金額。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each transaction uses the most recent rate effective on its own date. Adding a new rate never changes past records, except that transactions waiting for a rate get one. Currencies with no rate stay pending and are never counted at 1:1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每笔交易使用其日期当天有效的最新汇率。添加新汇率不会改变过去的记录，只会为等待汇率的交易补上汇率。没有汇率的币种保持待换算状态，绝不按 1:1 计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每筆交易使用其日期當天有效的最新匯率。新增新匯率不會改變過去的記錄，只會為等待匯率的交易補上匯率。沒有匯率的幣種保持待換算狀態，絕不按 1:1 計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
