    "Exports and backups are files you choose where to save. They are not encrypted — keep them somewhere safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出文件和备份保存在你选择的位置。它们未加密，请妥善保管。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯出檔案和備份保存在你選擇的位置。它們未加密，請妥善保管。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exports original amounts, currencies, the saved exchange rate, splits, payee and fees. Import needs Date and Amount columns; Chinese headers such as 日期, 金额, 分类 are recognised. Foreign-currency rows without an exchange rate are not imported. Duplicates are skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出原始金额、币种、保存的汇率、拆分、收付款方和手续费。导入需要“日期”和“金额”列，可识别日期、金额、分类等中文表头。没有汇率的外币行不会导入，重复记录会跳过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯出原始金額、幣種、保存的匯率、拆分、收付款方和手續費。匯入需要“日期”和“金額”列，可識別日期、金額、分類等中文表頭。沒有匯率的外幣行不會匯入，重複記錄會跳過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
