    "If the balances differ, Tally records a Balance Adjustment for the difference. It changes only this account's balance and never counts as income or spending.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果余额不一致，Tally 会为差额记录一笔余额调整。它只改变此账户的余额，不计入收入或支出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果餘額不一致，Tally 會為差額記錄一筆餘額調整。它只改變此帳戶的餘額，不計入收入或支出。"
