    "Installed outside the App Store, Tally does not update itself. A newer version arrives as a new IPA file; installing it over this one keeps your data. Create a backup before updating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tally 不是通过 App Store 安装的，不会自动更新。新版本以新的 IPA 文件提供，覆盖安装会保留数据。更新前请先创建备份。"
          }
        },
