    "Lock settings are stored in the Keychain. If Face ID fails, your device passcode can unlock Tally. Hide Amounts masks balances on every page until you turn it off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁定设置保存在钥匙串中。面容 ID 失败时可用设备密码解锁。隐藏金额会在所有页面遮挡金额，直到你关闭它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鎖定設定保存在鑰匙串中。Face ID 失敗時可用設備密碼解鎖。隱藏金額會在所有頁面遮擋金額，直到你關閉它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
