            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修復可修復的項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Repair fills in exchange rates for transactions that were waiting for one and pauses recurring plans whose account was deleted. Other items are listed so you can fix them yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修复会为等待汇率的交易补上汇率，并暂停账户已删除的周期计划。其他项目会列出，供你自行处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修復會為等待匯率的交易補上匯率，並暫停帳戶已刪除的週期計劃。其他項目會列出，供你自行處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Repay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还款"
