            "value": "替換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace erases everything on this iPhone first, then restores the backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "替换会先清空此 iPhone 上的全部数据，再恢复备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "替換會先清空此 iPhone 上的全部資料，再恢復備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reports use the rate saved with the transaction. If the main currency changes, the historical rate for the transaction date is used; without one the amount is shown as pending — never converted 1:1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "统计使用交易保存的汇率。如果本位币变更，则使用交易日期的历史汇率；没有汇率时显示为待换算，绝不按 1:1 换算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "統計使用交易保存的匯率。如果本位幣變更，則使用交易日期的歷史匯率；沒有匯率時顯示為待換算，絕不按 1:1 換算。"
          }
        }
      }
