    },
    "The account this transfer went to no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这笔转账的转入账户已不存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這筆轉帳的轉入帳戶已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The account “%@” no longer exists, so this transaction can't be restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账户「%@」已不存在，无法恢复这笔交易。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帳戶「%@」已不存在，無法恢復這筆交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The backup is damaged (checksum mismatch).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份已损坏（校验值不匹配）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份已損壞（校驗值不匹配）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The balance at the start of this day. Transactions dated earlier still appear in reports but don't change the balance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一天开始时的余额。更早日期的交易仍会出现在统计中，但不改变余额。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一天開始時的餘額。更早日期的交易仍會出現在統計中，但不改變餘額。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The currency can't change once transactions exist, so past amounts stay correct.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账户已有交易后无法更改币种，以确保历史金额准确。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帳戶已有交易後無法更改幣種，以確保歷史金額準確。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The discount can't be negative or more than the amount.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "折扣不能为负数，也不能大于金额。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "折扣不能為負數，也不能大於金額。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The discount lowers the spending in this purchase's categories; the fee is counted under Fees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "折扣会减少这笔消费所属分类的支出；手续费计入「手续费」分类。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "折扣會減少這筆消費所屬分類的支出；手續費計入「手續費」分類。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fee can't be negative.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
