    "Totals, analytics and budgets are shown in the base currency. Each transaction keeps its original amount, currency and the rate saved on its date; amounts without a rate are marked as pending and never counted at 1:1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合计、统计和预算以本位币显示。每笔交易保留原始金额、币种和当日保存的汇率；没有汇率的金额标记为待换算，绝不按 1:1 计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計、統計和預算以本位幣顯示。每筆交易保留原始金額、幣種和當日保存的匯率；沒有匯率的金額標記為待換算，絕不按 1:1 計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Totals, statistics and budgets are shown in this currency. You can change it later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "总额、统计和预算将以此币种显示，之后可随时更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "總額、統計和預算將以此幣種顯示，之後可隨時更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
